  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="10.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VIIIAtr">VIII Atr</ref> 10.1</head>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#robertson" n="10.1" corresp="#wit-d">⁊ se þe þæt nelle gelæstan, sille þar to eacan XXX p' ⁊ gilde þam cyninge CXX scill'.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#robertson" corresp="#wit-d">And he who refuses to render it shall give in addition 30 pence, and shall pay 120 shillings to the king.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="de" source="#liebermann">Und wer es zu leisten weigert, zahle 30 Pfennig ausserdem und zahle dem König 120 Schilling.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#claude" ana="#fromGerman">And whoever refuses to pay it, let him give 30 pence in addition and pay the king 120 shillings.</ab>
        <note type="editorial">Liebermann compares II Eg 4.1.</note>
      </div>
    </body>
